1
00:00:00,573 --> 00:00:03,363
l believe you two have prepared vows?

2
00:00:07,622 --> 00:00:12,002
(Bernadette:)Howard Joel Wolowitz, like you,
this is going to be short and sweet.

3
00:00:14,295 --> 00:00:19,715
l love you with all my heart and soul
and promise to be with you forever.

4
00:00:24,347 --> 00:00:27,477
(Howard:)Bernadette Maryann Rostenkowski...

5
00:00:27,684 --> 00:00:29,434
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Speak up!

6
00:00:29,644 --> 00:00:32,684
(Howard:)Hey, from now on, she's the only
woman who can yell at me!

7
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:43,990
(Howard:)Until I met you, I couldn't imagine
spending my life with just one person.

8
00:00:45,368 --> 00:00:51,708
(Howard:)And now I can't imagine spending
one day of it without you.

9
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:57,960
(All:)By the power vested in us
by the state of California...

10
00:00:58,173 --> 00:01:02,023
(Sheldon:)And the Klingon High Council.

